r study. So I guess small things do matter.", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 225}, {"session_id": "p000442-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "It's nice to hear that. Sometimes it's hard to see the impact of those small actions, but I'll try to stay focused on them.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 123}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261006T194747Z", "last_updated_at": "20261006T195822Z", "first_seen_session": "p000442-mem_needstate-s1", "last_session": "p000442-mem_needstate-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
